Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Fix chart disappearance after selection by adding WS
 kline subscriptions and grid cache warmup

- outbound/collector.py: Added watch_candles method to subscribe to WebSocket klines for chart grids, ensuring real-time data flow
- outbound/collector.py: Implemented _resubscribe_grid in CollectorHub to manage dynamic candle streams per exchange/timeframe
- outbound/collector.py: Enhanced warm_for_grid to pre-fetch requested timeframes into cache instead of relying solely on 1m resampling
- outbound/collector.py: Added _candle_tasks tracking and cleanup logic during pause/resume to prevent stale subscription errors
- .gitignore: Added rule to ignore *.patch files
